/// Inside a class method, a name that is not a local or a field of the
/// object reads the program's variable of that name; a field wins.
lim | 3
a | 99
<>P |
    a: 1
    act check()
        if a < lim
            say("less")
        xx
        y | lim + 1
        say("y {y}, a {a}")
    xx
xx
p <> P | a: 1
p.check()
